full_description: Bürgerwerke empowers people to implement the energy transition as a community.<br/><br/>

For over ten years, we have been one of the few genuine green electricity providers
in Germany. We have since grown into Germany’s largest network of energy
cooperatives. With more than 80,000 people in over 150 energy cooperatives, we are
working toward a single goal: putting the energy transition in the hands of the
people.

